{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02513","headline":"游清都观寻沈道士得都字 · 陆敬","name":"游清都观寻沈道士得都字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"聊排灵琐闼，徐步入清都。\n青谿冥寂士，思玄徇道枢。\n十芒生药笥，七焰发丹炉。\n缥袠桐君录，朱书王母符。\n宫槐散绿穗，日槿落青柎。\n矫翰雷门鹤，飞来叶县凫。\n凌风自可御，安事迫中区。\n方追羽化侣，从此得玄珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆敬","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02513.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02513","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}